# Coach Console configuration.
#
# Dev: leave PUBLIC_API_BASE empty — the Vite dev server proxies /api and /_allauth to
# the backend (set API_PROXY_TARGET to point the proxy elsewhere, default localhost:8000).
#
# Prod (static build): if the console is hosted on the SAME origin as the API (behind the
# same Caddy), leave PUBLIC_API_BASE empty (relative URLs). If hosted on a different origin
# (e.g. coach.tmlittau.com), set it to the API origin AND add that origin to the backend's
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS — app-token auth avoids CSRF but the browser still enforces CORS.
PUBLIC_API_BASE=

# Dev-only: where the Vite proxy forwards /api and /_allauth. The browser stays
# same-origin (localhost:5173) and Vite proxies server-side, so pointing this at a
# remote HTTPS backend needs no CORS/cert handling in the browser.
#   local backend:  http://localhost:8000
#   live prod data: https://bodybuilding.tmlittau.com
API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000
